WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:15.075
After shopping, we were very hungry, so we went to eat lunch.

2
00:00:15.076 --> 00:00:18.266
Mom: Hana, you can order whatever you want.

3
00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:19.973
Here is the money.

4
00:00:19.974 --> 00:00:21.957
Hana: What about Bada?

5
00:00:21.958 --> 00:00:24.452
Mom: I will order for both of us.

6
00:00:24.453 --> 00:00:29.166
Hana: Let me try.

7
00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:30.722
Clerk: May I help you?

8
00:00:30.723 --> 00:00:40.426
Hana: Yes. I would like a cheeseburger and a small order [n3@of French fries, please.

9
00:00:40.427 --> 00:00:41.959
Clerk: Anything to drink?

10
00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:44.853
Hana: A small orange juice, please.

11
00:00:44.854 --> 00:00:46.614
Clerk: For here or to go?

12
00:00:46.615 --> 00:00:49.802
Hana: For here.

13
00:00:49.803 --> 00:00:53.089
Clerk: That'll be $4.25, please.

14
00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:54.646
Hana: Here you are.

15
00:00:54.647 --> 00:00:56.328
Clerk: A five dollar bill.

16
00:00:56.329 --> 00:01:01.885
That's 75 cents change. Thank you.

17
00:01:01.886 --> 00:01:06.140
Hana: Umm . . . Can I have more ketchup?

18
00:01:06.141 --> 00:01:08.339
Clerk: Here you are.

19
00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:10.745
Hana: And where can I get a straw?

20
00:01:10.746 --> 00:01:16.458
Clerk: The straws are on the counter to your left.

21
00:01:16.459 --> 00:01:19.242
Hana: Oh, I see them. Thank you.

22
00:01:19.243 --> 00:01:21.004
Clerk: You are very welcome.

23
00:01:21.005 --> 00:01:24.491
Next, please.

24
00:01:24.492 --> 00:01:28.343
Yes, I ordered all by myself!

25
00:01:28.344 --> 00:01:31.298
I did a good job!
